350
00:13:47,460 --> 00:13:49,740
你个书呆子 我们又脏又累又迟到了
Nerd! And we're dirty and tired and late!

351
00:13:49,880 --> 00:13:51,240
够了 你们保持安静好不好
Okay! Can you please just be quiet!

352
00:13:51,660 --> 00:13:53,260
我们为什么不找人帮忙呢
Why couldn't we have just asked for help?

353
00:13:53,260 --> 00:13:55,240
因为我要给你们上宝贵的一课
'cause I'm teaching you girls a very valuable lesson--

354
00:13:55,240 --> 00:13:57,180
基佬不输直男 顶天立地好汉
That gay men can do anything straight men can do.

355
00:13:57,440 --> 00:13:58,600
我们知道啊
Yeah, we know that.

356
00:13:58,660 --> 00:14:00,460
你以为我们只认识你一个基佬吗
Do you think you're the only gay guy that we know?

357
00:14:00,460 --> 00:14:02,320
对 我的足球教练就是基佬
Yeah. My soccer coach is gay,

358
00:14:02,329 --> 00:14:03,351
儿科医生也是
Our pediatrician...

359
00:14:03,360 --> 00:14:05,800
-我的拉丁文家教 -书呆子 我们的电工
- My latin tutor. - Nerd! Our electrician.

360
00:14:05,880 --> 00:14:07,060
那我说我会开卡车的时候
Well, then why were you so surprised

361
00:14:07,060 --> 00:14:08,020
你们怎么那么震惊
when I said I could drive a truck?

362
00:14:08,031 --> 00:14:09,820
那不是因为你的性取向 而是因为你的性格
Not because you're gay, because you're you.

363
00:14:09,820 --> 00:14:11,420
再说 你的确不会开
And by the way, you can't.

364
00:14:11,500 --> 00:14:13,340
好吧 我向你们道歉
Okay, wow. I guess I owe you an apology.

365
00:14:13,480 --> 00:14:14,600
我会错意了
I made a leap there.

366
00:14:14,612 --> 00:14:16,108
因为人们对同志形象的陈旧认识
I'm just used to dealing with stereotypes.

367
00:14:16,120 --> 00:14:17,380
我有点太过敏感了
I'm a little sensitive about it.

368
00:14:17,941 --> 00:14:19,680
那是和我聊过天的卡车司机
Oh! There's the trucker that I talked to.

369
00:14:19,680 --> 00:14:21,020
打扰一下 你好
Hey! Excuse me! Hi!

370
00:14:21,140 --> 00:14:22,700
能帮我们一把吗
Could you give us a hand, please?

371
00:14:22,880 --> 00:14:23,880
没问题呀 亲爱的
Sure thing, sweetie.

372
00:14:24,800 --> 00:14:26,520
那人妖也能帮上忙吗
Oh, like she'll be able to help us.

373
00:14:30,640 --> 00:14:32,240
老爹 真是难以想象啊
Boy, do you have the right idea.

374
00:14:33,400 --> 00:14:35,660
总算从楼下的母子大重逢里
Could use a little break from the mother and child reunion

375
00:14:35,660 --> 00:14:36,600
解脱出来了
going on down there.

376
00:14:37,760 --> 00:14:38,560
别问
Don't ask.

377
00:14:42,240 --> 00:14:44,180
米奇尔把歌洛莉亚当亲妈了 瞧 我说了
Mitchell's turning Gloria into mom. Bam! It's out.

378
00:14:46,100 --> 00:14:48,220
你记得米奇尔和妈妈以前
You remember the way mom and Mitchell used to be

379
00:14:48,220 --> 00:14:50,500
总沉浸在他们的两人小世界吗
in their private little club,

380
00:14:50,600 --> 00:14:53,340
就他们俩 闲人勿进
Just the two of them, and no one else allowed in.

381
00:14:53,455 --> 00:14:56,758
历史又在重演啊
Well... it's happening again,

382
00:14:57,620 --> 00:15:01,580
但这一次 你老婆也有参与演出
But this time around, it's happening with your wife.

383
00:15:02,400 --> 00:15:04,360
你真该下去看看他俩
You should see them down there.

384
00:15:05,514 --> 00:15:08,067
要不是他俩太恶心 其实也挺可爱的
It would actually be adorable if it weren't so sick.

385
00:15:09,222 --> 00:15:10,493
我只是
I just--

386
00:15:10,640 --> 00:15:13,100
我觉得米奇尔都是成年人了
You know, I feel like Mitchell is a grown man,

387
00:15:13,500 --> 00:15:14,580
都是当爹的人了
he has a child,

388
00:15:14,720 --> 00:15:19,360
可还摆脱不了20年前的心理问题
and he's still working out some psychodrama from 20 years ago.

389
00:15:20,668 --> 00:15:23,018
爸 能让我喝口啤酒不
Daddy, can I have a sip of your beer, please?

390
00:15:28,780 --> 00:15:29,740
我的天啊
Oh, my god.

391
00:15:31,200 --> 00:15:34,060
米奇尔黏着妈妈 我就来投奔我爸
Mitchell cozies up to mom, I go running to daddy.

392
00:15:34,420 --> 00:15:37,060
我才是把歌洛莉亚当成亲妈的人
I'm the one who's turning Gloria into mom,

393
00:15:37,060 --> 00:15:39,420
明明我俩就一样大 真让人不安
which is really disturbing since we're the same age.

394
00:15:40,440 --> 00:15:41,300
你比她大
You're older.

395
00:15:42,488 --> 00:15:44,355
你憋了半天就吐槽这么一句吗
Oh. Oh, that's where we're gonna chime in?

396
00:15:45,840 --> 00:15:46,920
你能快点不
Will you hurry up?

397
00:15:47,320 --> 00:15:48,760
我在保存我的体力
I'm saving my strength

398
00:15:48,760 --> 00:15:50,200
因为如果我们找不到那架直升机
Because if we don't find this helicopter,

399
00:15:50,300 --> 00:15:51,180
我得逃往到加拿大去
I'm walking to Canada.

400
00:15:51,638 --> 00:15:53,748
希望你喜欢高税收
Hope you like taxes.

401
00:15:54,320 --> 00:15:55,780
瞧 那是我们的直升机
Hey! That's our helicopter!

402
00:15:56,280 --> 00:15:57,020
是吗
Is it, now?

403
00:15:57,260 --> 00:15:59,300
你有相关证明文件吗
I'm sure you have the proper documentation for that.

404
00:15:59,620 --> 00:16:01,240
快还给我们 是我们的
Just give it back. It's ours.

405
00:16:01,420 --> 00:16:02,220
你们是恶霸啊
You guys are bullies.

406
00:16:02,480 --> 00:16:04,320
他们才当不了恶霸 是书呆子才对
They can't be bullies. They're nerds.

407
00:16:04,320 --> 00:16:06,130
别分的那么细 我们可以是"恶霸书呆子"
Don't pigeonhole us. We can be both.

408
00:16:09,680 --> 00:16:11,240
有什么问题吗
Is there an issue here?

409
00:16:11,720 --> 00:16:14,660
小卡舅夫 我来搞定
Uncle Cam, I got this.

410
00:16:18,380 --> 00:16:19,740
我的天啊 是艾丽克斯·邓菲
Oh, my god, it's Alex Dunphy.

411
00:16:20,080 --> 00:16:20,560
好美啊
So awesome.

412
00:16:20,560 --> 00:16:22,240
杠上了吗 小伙子们
Problem here, boys?

413
00:16:22,520 --> 00:16:24,640
这些死宅男不肯把直升机还给我们
These geeks won't give us back our helicopter

414
00:16:24,640 --> 00:16:25,960
那是我们从罗本那儿抢来的
that we took from Reuben.

415
00:16:26,100 --> 00:16:27,440
是这样吗 亚伯拉罕
Is that right, Abraham?

416
00:16:27,600 --> 00:16:28,800
我的天啊 她知道你的大名
Oh, my god. She knows your name.

417
00:16:29,400 --> 00:16:30,700
直升机 还来
Helicopter, please.

418
00:16:36,580 --> 00:16:37,600
我爱你
I love you.

419
00:16:38,460 --> 00:16:39,400
刚刚什么情况
What just happened?

420
00:16:39,880 --> 00:16:42,420
你有帅哥追 我有宅男捧
You have your fans, I have mine.

421
00:16:42,870 --> 00:16:46,255
有朝一日 帅哥都得为宅男打工
Some day, your fans are going to work for my fans.

422
00:16:50,560 --> 00:16:51,840
那个 歌洛莉亚
Oh, um, Gloria,

423
00:16:51,940 --> 00:16:53,600
你介意我和米奇尔单独聊聊吗
Do you mind if I talk to Mitchell alone for a minute?

424
00:16:53,920 --> 00:16:56,340
没事的 我已经知道你说什么了
It's okay. I already know what you said,

425
00:16:56,340 --> 00:16:57,540
我觉得那也太离谱了
And I think it's crazy.

426
00:16:57,600 --> 00:16:59,300
米奇尔没有把我当他的妈咪啊
Mitchell is not making me his mommy.

427
00:16:59,440 --> 00:17:02,440
我知道他没有 但我想是我把你当妈了
No, I know. He's not, but I think that I might be.

428
00:17:02,840 --> 00:17:05,260
好吧 现在你更是疯话连篇了
Okay, now you're going really, really crazy,

429
00:17:05,260 --> 00:17:07,300
因为我可是比你还年轻哟
because I am younger than you.

430
00:17:07,571 --> 00:17:09,618
就年轻14个月 算了吧
Mm, by 14 months, so let's settle down.

431
00:17:10,300 --> 00:17:12,380
你今天怎么回事
What is going on with you today?

432
00:17:12,380 --> 00:17:15,469
我 好吧 我终于想明白了
I... all right, I'm working this out as I go.

433
00:17:17,180 --> 00:17:18,760
我觉得我今天见到
I think maybe seeing

434
00:17:18,760 --> 00:17:21,200
你和歌洛莉亚那么亲密
you get all buddy-buddy today with Gloria

435
00:17:21,200 --> 00:17:23,880
让我觉得想当年
made me feel like it did

436
00:17:23,880 --> 00:17:25,609
你和妈妈也如此 所以...
when you were with mom, and--and...

437
00:17:26,260 --> 00:17:28,900
我不知道 我觉得我被你们抛弃了
I don't know. I-I felt like the odd man out.

438
00:17:29,300 --> 00:17:31,520
其实 对于你和爸爸的关系 我也是同样的感觉
Okay. Well, that--that's how I used to feel with you and dad.

439
00:17:32,088 --> 00:17:35,825
我知道 我知道 我们各自选择阵营
I know. I know. We--we chose teams,

440
00:17:35,825 --> 00:17:37,642
就连爸妈离婚时也一样
even during the divorce. It...

441
00:17:39,800 --> 00:17:42,100
听我说 最近几年里
Okay, the last couple years,

442
00:17:42,300 --> 00:17:44,300
你和我是最亲密的
you and I have been our own team.

443
00:17:44,496 --> 00:17:47,220
明白吗 所以我不希望我们姐弟俩疏远了
You know? And I don't want that to go away.

444
00:17:48,200 --> 00:17:48,720
所以
So...

445
00:17:49,960 --> 00:17:51,800
我想我今天有点被冷落的感觉
I guess I just felt a little left out today.

446
00:17:52,020 --> 00:17:53,460
别说了
Shut up.

447
00:17:55,838 --> 00:17:57,600
好吧 你们能不能换成抱箱子
Okay, can you two try hugging a box

448
00:17:57,600 --> 00:18:00,680
好让你们可怜的后妈不那么辛苦
so that your poor mother doesn't have to do all the hard work?

449
00:18:00,760 --> 00:18:03,480
歌洛莉亚 实在抱歉今天说的那些疯话
I am sorry, Gloria, about all the mom stuff today.

450
00:18:03,480 --> 00:18:05,716
我只是 有个疯狂的想法
I just--I got this crazy idea

451
00:18:05,716 --> 00:18:07,630
觉得你喜欢米奇尔胜过我
that you liked Mitchell better than me.

452
00:18:07,640 --> 00:18:09,580
我的确更喜欢米奇尔
I do like Mitchell better than you.

453
00:18:10,060 --> 00:18:10,580
什么
What?

454
00:18:10,580 --> 00:18:12,036
哎呀 拜托
Ay, please.

455
00:18:12,060 --> 00:18:13,720
你敢不敢诚实地告诉我
Are you going to honestly tell me

456
00:18:13,720 --> 00:18:15,720
在这个家里你最喜欢我
that I'm your favorite person in this family?

457
00:18:16,120 --> 00:18:18,580
在这个家 我甚至不算你最喜欢的哥伦比亚人吧
I'm not even your favorite Colombian in this family.

458
00:18:18,700 --> 00:18:20,700
我是很想和你搞好关系
I would love to get closer to you.

459
00:18:20,900 --> 00:18:22,340
你知道我电话
You have my number.

460
00:18:22,620 --> 00:18:25,600
但是要早点打电话呦 很多人约我的
But call me quickly because I book up.

461
00:18:27,580 --> 00:18:28,840
你们谁也没看见我啊
You never saw me.

462
00:18:32,720 --> 00:18:33,700
你在这啊
There you are.

463
00:18:34,080 --> 00:18:36,120
-我真的需要和你谈谈 -完全没那必要
- I really need to talk to you. - You really don't.

464
00:18:36,280 --> 00:18:37,800
杰 拜托 是工作上的事
Jay, please. It's about work.

465
00:18:37,900 --> 00:18:39,460
给你按摩的时候我收到一条短息
I got a text during your massage.

466
00:18:39,460 --> 00:18:41,779
有一家新成立的公司请我去当合伙人
I've been offered a partnership in a new agency.

467
00:18:44,860 --> 00:18:45,860
那不赖啊
Good for you!

468
00:18:45,900 --> 00:18:46,960
我不确定
I'm not so sure.

469
00:18:47,066 --> 00:18:48,800
我是说 那的确算是大升职
I mean, there's--there's a big upside,

470
00:18:48,800 --> 00:18:50,680
但我现在有份稳定的工作
But I have a stable job right now.

471
00:18:51,520 --> 00:18:53,840
我有3个孩子 至少有一个会上大学的
I have three kids, and at least one of them's going to college.

472
00:18:53,977 --> 00:18:56,016
一不小心 3个都会上的
Worse case scenario, they all go.

473
00:18:56,360 --> 00:18:57,680
那么 克莱尔是怎么想的
Well, what does Claire think?

474
00:18:59,480 --> 00:19:01,820
我还没和她说呢 我想先跟你谈谈
I haven't told her yet. I wanted to talk to you first.

475
00:19:02,200 --> 00:19:03,060
你有经验
You've done this.

476
00:19:03,760 --> 00:19:06,540
其实 我觉得根本上其实只有一个问题
Well, I think that there's only really one question.

477
00:19:07,500 --> 00:19:09,300
我是否准备好自己下海创业吗
Whether I'm ready to run my own company?

478
00:19:09,358 --> 00:19:10,789
你很擅长与人打交道
Ah, you're great with people.

479
00:19:11,220 --> 00:19:12,500
我们知道你是个很好的推销员
We know you're a good salesman.

480
00:19:12,500 --> 00:19:14,700
你在经济不景气的时候 也让家人生活富足
You've managed to provide a good living in tough times.

481
00:19:15,406 --> 00:19:16,980
那问题是什么 恰当的时机吗
Then what? Is this the right time?

482
00:19:16,980 --> 00:19:17,960
永远都没有恰当的时机
Never a perfect time.

483
00:19:18,140 --> 00:19:19,400
没准房子明天就烧了
House could burn down tomorrow.

484
00:19:19,860 --> 00:19:22,620
问题是 你到底想不想这么做
Question is, do you want this?

485
00:19:23,940 --> 00:19:24,380
想
Yeah.

486
00:19:25,560 --> 00:19:26,820
想 我真想自己干
Yeah, I really want it.

487
00:19:26,940 --> 00:19:28,540
那就赌自己一把
Then gamble on yourself.

488
00:19:30,340 --> 00:19:31,980
我赌你赢
I'd gamble on you.

489
00:19:34,650 --> 00:19:35,480
那我就干
I'm gonna do it.

490
00:19:35,480 --> 00:19:36,200
那不就得了
There you go!

491
00:19:37,520 --> 00:19:38,260
谢了 杰
Thanks, Jay.

492
00:19:38,840 --> 00:19:41,320
听着 我知道你之前不太愿意做按摩
Hey, look, I know you were reluctant to get that massage,

493
00:19:41,420 --> 00:19:44,060
但我觉得 现在是皆大欢喜了
but I think we can both agree it had a happy ending.

494
00:19:45,760 --> 00:19:46,880
求你别说"欢喜"
Please don't say that.

495
00:19:47,340 --> 00:19:50,260
如果我只能在火灾中带走一样物品
If I could only save one possession in a fire,

496
00:19:50,860 --> 00:19:52,780
应该会救我的第一套高尔夫球杆
probably my first set of golf clubs.

497
00:19:52,780 --> 00:19:54,642
是我老爸给我的
My old man gave 'em to me.

498
00:19:57,640 --> 00:19:59,560
杰给我的结婚戒指
The engagement ring that Jay gave me

499
00:19:59,560 --> 00:20:00,760
改变了我的一生
that changed my life.

500
00:20:01,820 --> 00:20:03,080
莉莉的领养证书
Lily's adoption papers.

501
00:20:03,080 --> 00:20:05,432
我本来也想说是领养证书
I was gonna say adoption papers.

502
00:20:05,520 --> 00:20:08,600
既然你已经拿了 我就拿走我妈的菜谱
So I guess, then, I would say my mom's recipe book.

503
00:20:10,020 --> 00:20:11,600
所有的家庭照片
All our family photos...

504
00:20:12,320 --> 00:20:15,260
我都存在iPad里 那就拿iPad吧
which I keep on my iPad, so my iPad.

505
00:20:16,460 --> 00:20:17,680
只要我的家人在身边
As long as I have my family,

506
00:20:17,740 --> 00:20:19,240
我就什么都不需要了
I wouldn't need anything else.

507
00:20:19,240 --> 00:20:20,680
太假了
Aw, man!

508
00:20:20,680 --> 00:20:21,240
怎么了嘛
What?

509
00:20:21,620 --> 00:20:22,860
你说的境界那么高
You say something like that,

510
00:20:22,860 --> 00:20:24,180
让我们显得好渺小
it makes us all seem petty.

511
00:20:24,180 --> 00:20:24,868
-就是 -其实
- Yeah. - Well...

512
00:20:25,080 --> 00:20:26,540
我故意的
I know.

513
00:20:30,920 --> 00:20:32,260
讨厌
Hiss!

514
00:20:37,888 --> 00:20:39,540
小卡睡着了 我不想把他吵醒
Cam's sleeping. I don't wanna wake him.

515
00:20:39,540 --> 00:20:40,480
他今天可悲催了
He's had a rough day.

516
00:20:40,480 --> 00:20:41,489
那也没外公的卡车悲催
Not as rough as grandpa's truck.

517
00:20:44,720 --> 00:20:46,200
多谢你们载我回家
Thank you so much for driving me.

518
00:20:46,360 --> 00:20:47,920
我真的不想开那大卡车
I really didn't want to ride in that big rig.

519
00:20:48,080 --> 00:20:50,220
难忘的经历啊 当时所有人都在按喇叭
It was amazing. Everybody was honking,

520
00:20:50,340 --> 00:20:51,900
而且我还学了差不多五句脏话
And I learned, like, five new curse words.

521
00:20:52,140 --> 00:20:53,400
大多都是小卡说的
Mostly from Cam.

522
00:20:54,760 --> 00:20:56,560
真高兴今天能博得您二位千金一笑
Oh, I'm glad I could give you a laugh today.

523
00:20:56,920 --> 00:20:58,260
我还不知道我在你们眼里
You know, I didn't know that's what I was to you people--

524
00:20:58,360 --> 00:21:00,920
-就一笑料 -不是那样的 亲爱的
- a big joke. - No, honey, it wasn't like that.

525
00:21:01,037 --> 00:21:02,319
我们不是故意的 小卡舅夫我们爱你
No, we really didn't mean-- uncle Cam, we love you.

526
